# Frontend Rules

## UI
- Follow docs/DESIGN.md exactly. Use tokens, never raw hex in components.
- Include loading, error, and empty states. Keep mobile responsive.
- Animations only via shared primitives and always respect reduced motion.
- UI components contain no fetch logic. Network calls live in `src/services/`.
- All content strings live in `src/data/`, not scattered through JSX.
- Owner role/title: [FILL: title]. Never invent facts or metrics.
- Keep `[FILL: ...]` placeholders out of public-facing website.
